WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:25.940
But you're all it takes for me to break a promise

2
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:34.340
I haven't slept since Sunday

3
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.940
Midnight for me is 3:00 a.m. for you

4
00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:47.240
But my sleepless nights are better

5
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:53.880
With you than nights could ever be alone, ooh-ooh-ooh

6
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:02.580
I was good at feeling nothing, now I'm hopeless

7
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:09.020
What a drag to love you like I do, ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh

